GPUI screenshot theme
---------------------
The GPUI frontend uses the user-supplied reference image (ADR 0003).
assets/ui-icons.ttf is Material Symbols Rounded (outlined), from egui_icons,
under Apache License 2.0. The brand SVG outlines in assets/brands (except Godot, Gradle, OpenAI, NuGet and npm-square)
are exported from egui_icons' bundled Material Design Icons font, Copyright
Pictogrammers, under the Apache License 2.0.
Godot's logo is from devicons/devicon (MIT), originally the Godot Engine logo
(Copyright Juan Linietsky, Ariel Manzur and contributors, CC BY 4.0).
Source: https://github.com/devicons/devicon/blob/master/icons/godot/godot-original.svg
It is used because egui_icons has no suitable Godot brand glyph.

Licenses: docs/third-party/LICENSE-PICTOGRAMMERS.txt and
docs/third-party/LICENSE-DEVICON.txt.
Godot logo license: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Godot press kit: https://godotengine.org/press/

Developer-tools icon exceptions
------------------------------
Gradle uses devicons/devicon's actual Gradle elephant (MIT); egui_icons' generic
elephant does not match the reference brand silhouette. OpenAI and NuGet use
Simple Icons v15.0.0 SVGs (CC0), as egui_icons has no matching brand glyphs.
Sources: https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons/tree/15.0.0/icons
The npm-square vector follows the reference image's compact logomark; the
egui_icons npm glyph is a wide wordmark and does not fit that reference slot.
Brand marks are used to identify their respective tools.

Simple Icons license: docs/third-party/LICENSE-SIMPLE-ICONS.txt.
